// The rope gun's hook bites solid rock only. At tick 10 it is thrown at a heap of sand: it glances off and the
// hook rope falls there (no rope). At 70 into the pool: it sinks (no rope). At 130 up at the granite ceiling,
// 7.5 m above: it bites, and the rope stays. It survives a save and load, and when the rock the hook bit is
// blown away the rope comes down as a hook rope item.
map
